WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Your shift starts at 8:00 a.m.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
At 7:48, your bus meets a diversion.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The journey screen shows 22 minutes: arrival about 8:10.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Cause. Delay. Arrival. Follow-up.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
I'm running late. I expect to arrive at 8:10.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Write the delay, arrival time, and follow-up.
